1	66	version.layout	474	{"root": {"type": "root", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Showcasing Langkawi’s stunning scenic beauty, the award-winning Danna Langkawi Resort & Beach Villas welcomes you with genuine island hospitality while delighting you at every turn. Take your time to explore this luxury beachfront resort which features exclusive private pool villas, colonial oceanfront rooms and suites that boast views ranging from tropical mountains, ocean, marina and courtyard – featuring bespoke Jo Loves by Jo Malone CBE bath amenities. Indulge in eclectic and intimate seaside dining, keep up with your wellness regime at the Techno gym fitness centre or rejuvenate over therapeutic treatments at The Spa for balance of body, mind and soul. Located in Telaga Harbour Park, this Mediterranean-inspired beach resort is easily accessible to many of Langkawi’s famous attractions and outdoor activities. It takes approximately 15 minutes from the Langkawi International Airport and 25 minutes from Pantai Cenang to The Danna Langkawi Resort & Beach Villas.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}], "direction": null}}	6a60da2b5b97b27ca62d2dc6	About
