1	14	19	oneThird	{"root": {"type": "root", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"tag": "h3", "type": "heading", "format": "left", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "We provide a comprehensive range of Sales and Marketing representation services in India to luxury hotel companies and independent hotels. We also offer a carefully curated collection of exceptional boutique hotels, luxury wellness resorts, safari lodges, extraordinary estates & villas as well as bespoke journeys and unique experiences for discerning individuals.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null}], "direction": null}}	\N	reference	\N	\N	\N	default	6a6123de68ad716fe24ad787
2	14	20	twoThirds	{"root": {"type": "root", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "The Founders of 1524 Delhi have over 50 years of operations, sales and business management experience in luxury hotels and travel related services. Encouraged by the exponential growth in travel from and within India, in 2011, we founded a Sales & Marketing representation company to promote some of the world’s most famous luxury hotel brands to travellers and travel arrangers in India and South East Asia.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "As we established our business, we felt the tug of two strong currents driving the luxury travel and lifestyle industry.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "In recent years, India has recorded its fastest growth in personal wealth. With the exponential growth in affluence, there is a large and rapidly growing segment of wealthy individuals with the desire to explore the world and experience the extraordinary. They possess the means to indulge their passion. However, given their commitments, the one thing they do not possess is the luxury of time to seek out and plan their next adventure.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "At the same time, India and Asia have witnessed the emergence of exceptional boutique hotels, resorts and safari lodges. Each property is unique with distinct characteristics, individual charm and experiences that set it apart from other hotels – chain or individual. While they are exceptional and created with enormous passion, independent hotels have limited reach or Sales & Marketing resources – inadvertently making them “hidden gems” or “the best-kept secret”.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "Encouraged by friends who are hotel owners, travellers or travel industry colleagues, in 2017, we founded 1524 Delhi to serve as a bridge that introduces exceptional hotels and experiences to discerning individuals. Thereby helping them to discover their passion.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}], "direction": null}}	\N	reference	\N	\N	\N	default	6a6123df68ad716fe24ad789
1	15	21	oneThird	{"root": {"type": "root", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"tag": "h3", "type": "heading", "format": "left", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "We provide a comprehensive range of Sales and Marketing representation services in India to luxury hotel companies and independent hotels. We also offer a carefully curated collection of exceptional boutique hotels, luxury wellness resorts, safari lodges, extraordinary estates & villas as well as bespoke journeys and unique experiences for discerning individuals.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null}], "direction": null}}	\N	reference	\N	\N	\N	default	6a6123de68ad716fe24ad787
2	15	22	twoThirds	{"root": {"type": "root", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "The Founders of 1524 Delhi have over 50 years of operations, sales and business management experience in luxury hotels and travel related services. Encouraged by the exponential growth in travel from and within India, in 2011, we founded a Sales & Marketing representation company to promote some of the world’s most famous luxury hotel brands to travellers and travel arrangers in India and South East Asia.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "As we established our business, we felt the tug of two strong currents driving the luxury travel and lifestyle industry.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "In recent years, India has recorded its fastest growth in personal wealth. With the exponential growth in affluence, there is a large and rapidly growing segment of wealthy individuals with the desire to explore the world and experience the extraordinary. They possess the means to indulge their passion. However, given their commitments, the one thing they do not possess is the luxury of time to seek out and plan their next adventure.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "At the same time, India and Asia have witnessed the emergence of exceptional boutique hotels, resorts and safari lodges. Each property is unique with distinct characteristics, individual charm and experiences that set it apart from other hotels – chain or individual. While they are exceptional and created with enormous passion, independent hotels have limited reach or Sales & Marketing resources – inadvertently making them “hidden gems” or “the best-kept secret”.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "Encouraged by friends who are hotel owners, travellers or travel industry colleagues, in 2017, we founded 1524 Delhi to serve as a bridge that introduces exceptional hotels and experiences to discerning individuals. Thereby helping them to discover their passion.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}], "direction": null}}	\N	reference	\N	\N	\N	default	6a6123df68ad716fe24ad789
