1	27	version.layout	114	{"root": {"type": "root", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Welcome to The Villa in the Woods, a hidden gem nestled amidst the serene beauty of the hill slopes between Bhimtal and Mukteshwar. This enchanting three-bedroom homestay is part of the larger Devānya project, which embraces sustainable engineering and an eco-conscious lifestyle.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "At The Villa in the Woods, you can escape the hustle and bustle of city life and immerse yourself in the tranquility of nature. Surrounded by lush greenery and breathtaking views, this retreat offers a unique opportunity to go off the grid while still enjoying the luxuries you're accustomed to.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "Your stay at the villa is made even more delightful by the attentive and friendly staff, ensuring that your every need is catered to. Indulge in a culinary journey as you savour a blend of international, Kumaoni, and Rajasthani home-cooked delicacies. The meals are prepared using seasonal organic produce and grains sourced from Devānya's own organic farms or local farmers, guaranteeing freshness and sustainability.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "Whether you seek relaxation, adventure, or simply a break from the ordinary, The Villa in the Woods at RAAS Devānya promises an unforgettable experience. Immerse yourself in the natural beauty, relish the delectable cuisine, and create cherished memories in this idyllic haven.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}], "direction": null}}	6a5e297140b3173cd7c02af4	\N
